<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>แลกของสำเร็จ</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: "Prompt", system-ui, sans-serif;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, #ff2d92 0%, transparent 40%),
                  radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, #00d4ff 0%, transparent 40%),
                  #0b0f14;
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(16, 23, 34, 0.9);
      border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 40px 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.3),
                  0 0 60px rgba(255, 45, 146, 0.2);
      max-width: 360px;
      width: 90%;
      animation: glow 2s infinite alternate;
    }

    @keyframes glow {
      from { box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.3); }
      to   { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255, 45, 146, 0.45); }
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #00d4ff;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 212, 255, 0.5);
    }

    p {
      margin: 8px 0;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .reward {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: #ff2d92;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 45, 146, 0.5);
    }

    .used {
      color: #9bb0c7;
    }

    .notice {
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #ffec87;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 236, 135, 0.6);
      animation: blink 1.2s infinite alternate;
    }

    @keyframes blink {
      0% { opacity: 1; }
      100% { opacity: 0.6; }
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d4ff, #ff2d92);
      border: none;
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 45, 146, 0.4);
      transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(255, 45, 146, 0.6);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>🎉 แลกสำเร็จ!</h1>
    <p><strong><%= user.Name %></strong> ได้แลก</p>
    <p class="reward"><%= reward %></p>
    <p class="used">หักแต้มไป <strong><%= usedPoints %></strong> แต้ม</p>
    <p class="notice">✨ โปรดยื่นหน้านี้ให้พนักงานดู ✨</p>
    <a class="btn" href="/home">กลับหน้า Home</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
